    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA akagamba ati: Iwe omwana w'omuntu, kwata empirima enyakutoire; ogyekoonyeze nk'orumoiso rw'omumwisa okyemwise isoke n'omuleju; hanyuma okwate minzaani ey'okulengesa, obaganizeemu isoke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimu kya kasatu eky'isoke eri, olyokeze omu rubuga, ebiro eby'okurugota bimazire kuhwaho; ekimu kya kasatu ekindi, okitemateme n'empirima yaawe, oyehingulirize orubuga; ekicweka ekisigaireho, okimiise omu mwanya, nukwo nsomole empirima ndikurate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha bicweka ebi, oiheho isoke like, olibohere omu mukugiro gw'ekanzu yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ha isoke eri, ogaruke oiheho like, olinage omu murro lihye; omu, haliimukamu omurro, gutaahe omunju ya Isirairi yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: Murole, egi niyo Yerusaalemu ei nataire hagati y'amahanga n'ensi ezigyehinguliriize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekagaya muno ebigambo byange okukira amahanga agandi, kandi ekagaya ebiragiro byange okukira ensi ezindi ezigyehinguliriize, neyanga ebigambo byange, kandi etarukugendera ha biragiro byange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga arukugambira ati: “Habwokuba muli beereme okukira amahanga agabeehinguliriize, kandi mutakwate biragiro byange timwahurra n'ebigambo byange, baitu mwakwata ebiragiro eby'amahanga agabeehinguliriize, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habweki, nyowe MUKAMA Ow'ekitiinisa, nimbagambira nti: ndi munyanzigwa wanyu. Ndibacwera omusango, amahanga goona nigarora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habw'ebibi byanyu ebi byona, ndibakora eki ntakakoraga, kandi eki ntaligaruka kukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LAM.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emp 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, baise baana, balirya abaana baabu, n'abaana balirya baise bo; ndibacwera omusango, kandi abamu omuli inywe abaliba basigaireho ndibararangya omu nsonda zoona ez'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagamba ati: Mazima nkooku ndi mwomeezi, nindahira nkooku mwasiisire ekiikaro kyange ekirukwera nimukorramu ebintu byanyu ebibi, na habw'obubi bwanyu obu bwona, ndibakeehya; eriiso lyange tiririganyira, kandi tindigira mbabazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimu kya kasatu omuli inywe kiriitwa endwara kandi kimarweho kiihe; kimu kya kasatu ekindi, kiriitwa empirima; kimu kya kasatu ekisigaireho, ndikirarangya omu nsonda zoona ez'ensi, nsomole empirima nkikuraatire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aho, nuho ekiniga kirimpwera, kandi ndimarraho obukaya; obu, nyowe MUKAMA nkooku nabalize nyina ekiniga, obu nabamaliireho obukaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ekindi, ndikufoora kitongo kandi kintu eky'okusekwa omu mahanga agakwehinguliriize, n'abantu boona abahinguzi abaraakuroraga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oraajumwaga, oraagaywaga, oraahaburaga kandi oraatiinisaaga amahanga agakwehinguliriize, obu ndikucwera omusango mbiihiirwe kandi nyina obukaya, obu ndikuha ebifubiro eby'amaani; ebi bigambirwe nyowe MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndikeehya ebyokulya byawe, nkuleke oitwe enjara olihurra obusaalizi obw'amaani ag'ekiniga kyange, nibucumita nk'emisogi enyakurasirwe kuhwerekereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 6:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndireeta kiihe n'enyamaiswa ez'omwirungu, ebi birikunyagaho abaana bawe; ndireeta endwara, ebintu ebigumire, n'obulemu, bikwate ninyowe MUKAMA, ninyowe ngambire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
